[Tell me more!][314]

## Answering your questions

We know you might have some questions, so here are some of our most frequently asked ones.

Who are Alternative Airlines?

Never heard of us? We get it, we do things a little differently.


We’re all about putting you in control and giving you the freedom to travel your way. Compare
[flights from over 600 airlines][315], add the extras you need, and choose how to pay, upfront or
over time, all in one simple place.


Once you’ve booked your flight, our dedicated customer support team is here 7 days a week to help
with anything you need.

Can I pay later for my flights?

Yes. At Alternative Airlines, we offer over 40 ways to pay, including flexible pay-later options
that let you split the cost or book now and pay the rest later.


Alternative Airlines works with leading global providers like [Affirm][316], [Afterpay][317],
[Klarna][318], [Tamara][319], [Atome][320] and many more. This means you can choose a payment plan
that works for your budget, whether that's splitting your flight cost into **3-4 weekly
instalments** or paying a small deposit now and the rest before departure.


Most pay-later options don't require a hard credit check, and many come with zero interest when you
pay on time. We've built the world's most flexible flight booking experience so you can book your
trip today without paying everything up front

Can I add seats and bags after booking?

Yes. At Alternative Airlines, you can **add seats and bags** to your booking after you've completed
your purchase.


Once your flight is confirmed, you can manage your booking through our Manage My Booking portal. Use
your booking reference and last name to access your booking.


